WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:27.910
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:27.910 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 2]

01:35.620 --> 01:37.780
If he fails,

01:37.820 --> 01:40.420
I'm afraid you have
to stay here forever.

01:42.060 --> 01:43.580
I'm not that important.

01:44.100 --> 01:45.860
You're the key here.

01:47.700 --> 01:49.500
What will you do

01:50.340 --> 01:51.700
if Fan Xian dies?

01:57.460 --> 02:00.060
If Fan Xian ends up dead,

02:01.900 --> 02:04.140
many people will join him
in the afterlife.

02:33.780 --> 02:34.860
Mr. Fan.

02:35.300 --> 02:36.600
Nian.

02:36.620 --> 02:37.300
Baba!

02:37.300 --> 02:38.560
Nian.

02:38.580 --> 02:39.700
Baba.

02:40.580 --> 02:42.140
I missed you very much.

02:42.180 --> 02:44.480
You were sleeping soundly this morning,

02:44.500 --> 02:46.540
so I didn't wake you up.

02:46.860 --> 02:48.460
I missed you terribly.

02:48.620 --> 02:50.100
Get back to your business.

02:51.460 --> 02:52.980
Thank you, dear.

02:55.460 --> 02:56.540
Come.

02:56.860 --> 02:58.260
Nian.

02:59.140 --> 03:00.220
Go inside.

03:03.500 --> 03:05.300
Thank you, dear.

03:08.340 --> 03:09.860
Mr. Fan, here's what you asked for.

03:10.620 --> 03:12.720
I noticed something was off out there.

03:12.740 --> 03:13.820
What's wrong?

03:13.900 --> 03:15.760
Have you found anything
about the Teng family?

03:15.780 --> 03:17.160
Not yet.

03:17.180 --> 03:18.880
But while I was asking around,

03:18.900 --> 03:21.460
I discovered the news of your death
has spread not just among the populace,

03:21.460 --> 03:23.460
but also within the court.

03:23.740 --> 03:24.820
So?

03:27.460 --> 03:28.440
So,

03:28.460 --> 03:29.760
I don't think it's good

03:29.780 --> 03:31.040
if this gets out of hand.

03:31.060 --> 03:33.760
How will you explain
to His Majesty later?

03:33.780 --> 03:35.120
This is a crime of deceiving the ruler.

03:35.140 --> 03:36.420
Your head could roll.

03:37.300 --> 03:38.280
I know.

03:38.300 --> 03:41.160
If so, let's return
to the diplomatic corps

03:41.180 --> 03:43.260
and tell them that your death
is misinformation.

03:43.900 --> 03:45.980
Don't worry. I thought about that.

03:46.140 --> 03:47.820
As long as you are prepared.

03:48.340 --> 03:50.460
Keep on searching for the Tengs.

03:51.220 --> 03:53.540
Are you returning
to the diplomatic corps by yourself?

03:53.580 --> 03:54.860
I'm going to request an audience
with His Majesty.

03:55.060 --> 03:56.160
His Majesty?

03:56.180 --> 03:58.600
Mr. Fan, the news of your death
is making the rounds.

03:58.620 --> 03:59.760
If you meet His Majesty now,

03:59.780 --> 04:00.880
you are meeting your death.

04:00.900 --> 04:01.980
Indeed.

04:02.220 --> 04:03.440
It's difficult.

04:03.460 --> 04:05.280
But a dead end
is where we seek survival.

04:05.300 --> 04:07.320
That being said,

04:07.340 --> 04:09.560
what if it doesn't guarantee
a chance of survival?

04:09.580 --> 04:11.060
Are you just going straight
to the dead end now?

04:11.060 --> 04:12.860
There is no other way.

04:12.940 --> 04:14.920
I have to face it anyway.
I should give it a go.

04:14.940 --> 04:16.380
Wait, Mr. Fan.

04:16.380 --> 04:18.480
You shouldn't risk your own life though.

04:18.500 --> 04:19.580
Wang,

04:20.140 --> 04:21.320
if I die,

04:21.340 --> 04:22.780
you should move.

04:22.940 --> 04:25.340
Don't stay in the Capital.
This place is no fun.

04:25.700 --> 04:26.600
I...

04:26.620 --> 04:27.700
Mr. Fan.

04:28.500 --> 04:29.580
Mr. Fan.

04:30.020 --> 04:31.140
Mr. Fan!

04:31.580 --> 04:32.700
Mr. Fan!

04:33.020 --> 04:35.420
You must seek survival!

04:35.780 --> 04:37.560
I remember you told me

04:37.580 --> 04:40.220
that Mr. Fan is incredibly intelligent.

04:41.500 --> 04:42.860
Of course.

04:43.620 --> 04:46.220
Mr. Fan is nothing

04:46.580 --> 04:48.700
but a paragon of wisdom.

04:49.020 --> 04:50.540
Then why are you so worried?

04:50.820 --> 04:53.700
Because the path he chose is a dead end.

05:07.260 --> 05:08.160
Intruder!

05:08.180 --> 05:09.000
Intruder!

05:09.020 --> 05:09.760
Seize the intruder!

05:09.780 --> 05:10.500
Seize the intruder!

05:10.500 --> 05:11.980
- Freeze!
- Freeze!

05:13.940 --> 05:16.100
Don't panic.

05:16.140 --> 05:18.460
I'm just an ordinary intruder.

05:18.900 --> 05:22.160
Can you all please stop embarrassing me?

05:22.180 --> 05:24.240
I even received complaints

05:24.260 --> 05:27.000
on cleaning jobs like such.

05:27.020 --> 05:30.140
Cut me some slack, will you?

05:30.820 --> 05:31.800
Sir.

05:31.820 --> 05:32.920
The guard says

05:32.940 --> 05:34.240
an intruder wants to see you.

05:34.260 --> 05:35.340
You see,

05:35.780 --> 05:36.900
even an...

05:40.225 --> 05:41.260
[Eunuch Hou, Eunuch Superintendent]

05:41.260 --> 05:43.780
[Eunuch Hou, Eunuch Superintendent]
Who wants to see me?

05:44.820 --> 05:46.860
Eunuch Hou.

05:47.580 --> 05:49.320
He is very familiar
with every corner of the palace.

05:49.340 --> 05:50.040
He doesn't seem to be an outsider.

05:50.060 --> 05:50.880
So we think

05:50.900 --> 05:53.300
we should let you take a look first.

05:53.460 --> 05:55.020
A bunch of cowards.

05:57.140 --> 05:58.220
Move aside.

06:01.020 --> 06:02.420
Hi, Eunuch Hou.

06:06.060 --> 06:06.920
Disperse.

06:06.940 --> 06:08.020
Disperse.

06:19.500 --> 06:20.580
Oh, Mr. Fan.

06:20.580 --> 06:22.240
What are you doing here?

06:22.260 --> 06:24.360
Eunuch Hou,
please relay a message for me.

06:24.380 --> 06:25.560
What is it about?

06:25.580 --> 06:26.780
I want to seek an audience
with His Majesty.

06:26.820 --> 06:28.360
No, you don't.

06:28.380 --> 06:30.120
His Majesty is livid at the moment.

06:30.140 --> 06:32.900
You don't want to seek death.

06:36.780 --> 06:38.180
Please tell His Majesty

06:38.180 --> 06:39.600
that I have a reason.

06:39.620 --> 06:40.480
I'll only meet him this one time.

06:40.500 --> 06:41.920
Oh, Mr. Fan.

06:41.940 --> 06:45.020
I beg of you. Please leave.

06:45.140 --> 06:47.000
Please, just relay this message for me.

06:47.020 --> 06:49.420
His Majesty is angry with you.

06:49.620 --> 06:51.320
If I were to do that,

06:51.340 --> 06:53.800
I might die along with you.

06:53.820 --> 06:55.920
This may sound inappropriate.

06:55.940 --> 06:57.360
Given the current situation,

06:57.380 --> 06:58.680
if you don't leave,

06:58.700 --> 07:00.220
you will meet your dead end here.

07:00.620 --> 07:02.680
So put on your mask

07:02.700 --> 07:04.540
and leave the way you came.

07:05.020 --> 07:07.660
I'll pretend we never met.

07:43.180 --> 07:44.580
You faked your death
and deceived His Majesty.

07:44.940 --> 07:46.300
This

07:46.340 --> 07:47.260
is utterly foolish!

07:47.260 --> 07:48.340
Or what?

07:48.500 --> 07:49.780
What else could I have done?

07:50.380 --> 07:51.800
No matter how serious the matter was,

07:51.820 --> 07:53.040
you should have endured it
until your return to the Capital.

07:53.060 --> 07:54.000
Lives were at risk.

07:54.020 --> 07:54.920
I couldn't wait.

07:54.940 --> 07:55.820
What about your own life?

07:55.820 --> 07:56.900
So?

07:58.020 --> 07:59.920
Do you want
to take my life now, Mr. Chen?

07:59.940 --> 08:02.360
You should know
what you are getting into.

08:02.380 --> 08:02.940
I do.

08:02.940 --> 08:03.880
What do you know?

08:03.900 --> 08:04.900
Everyone is telling me

08:04.900 --> 08:06.360
that if I meet His Majesty now,
I will die for sure.

08:06.380 --> 08:08.480
The only way to survive
is to leave the Capital.

08:08.500 --> 08:09.900
If you do so,

08:10.380 --> 08:11.680
it's nothing different
from killing yourself.

08:11.700 --> 08:12.680
By that logic,

08:12.700 --> 08:13.800
there is no way
for me to survive at all.

08:13.820 --> 08:14.900
Correct.

08:15.700 --> 08:18.140
If you meet His Majesty,
you will die.

08:18.340 --> 08:20.460
To survive, you must die first.

08:21.500 --> 08:23.340
Risk your life to meet His Majesty

08:23.380 --> 08:25.300
and you may secure a path to survival.

08:27.140 --> 08:29.100
If His Majesty spares you,

08:29.340 --> 08:31.040
you might get through this.

08:31.060 --> 08:32.900
But I haven't even had
a chance to meet him.

08:42.020 --> 08:44.420
I will try to persuade His Majesty.

08:44.780 --> 08:46.180
Whether or not you would die,

08:46.260 --> 08:47.540
it is uncertain.

08:59.140 --> 09:01.020
I know you don't trust me now,

09:01.020 --> 09:02.180
which is a good thing.

09:03.740 --> 09:06.420
If you still trust me blindly,

09:07.260 --> 09:08.660
you are done for.

09:11.220 --> 09:13.780
But now you have no choice.

09:23.980 --> 09:25.060
Wait.

09:32.660 --> 09:35.233
Please pass this on to His Majesty.

09:35.253 --> 09:36.373
Don't open it.

09:37.260 --> 09:38.900
I don't need to know what is inside.

09:39.380 --> 09:41.620
Xiao En revealed the secret
of the temple before he died.

09:41.620 --> 09:42.960
If His Majesty doesn't mention

09:42.980 --> 09:44.080
the temple,

09:44.100 --> 09:45.420
do not bring it up.

09:47.740 --> 09:49.900
If His Majesty agrees to meet you today,

09:50.140 --> 09:51.900
you must keep this in mind.

09:52.260 --> 09:53.480
Before you are certain

09:53.500 --> 09:56.500
you can come back to life honorably,
don't come to me.

09:56.860 --> 09:58.240
Whatever you want to do
or whoever you want to save,

09:58.260 --> 09:59.780
I won't help you either.

10:00.420 --> 10:02.780
Just consider you have no allies
here in the Capital.

10:02.980 --> 10:04.120
You are on your own.

10:04.140 --> 10:05.720
I can't go to other places either?

10:05.740 --> 10:07.380
Don't return to the Fan's Residence
or come to see me.

10:07.380 --> 10:09.540
As for the rest,
you decide for yourself.

10:17.140 --> 10:18.220
Thanks.

10:25.740 --> 10:27.780
Greetings, Your Majesty.

10:34.900 --> 10:36.500
I have good news

10:36.740 --> 10:38.420
to report.

10:39.620 --> 10:42.240
The news of Fan Xian's death
spread throughout the capital,

10:42.260 --> 10:45.477
stirring up the righteous indignation
of our Great Qing's literati,

10:45.477 --> 10:46.640
inspiring them

10:46.660 --> 10:48.280
to redouble their efforts
and forge ahead.

10:48.300 --> 10:49.513
[Emperor Qing]
Northern Qi has thus far

10:49.514 --> 10:51.360
[The Ruler of the Qing State]
prevailed in literature.

10:51.380 --> 10:53.020
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

10:53.780 --> 10:56.620
Now, the tide has turned.

10:56.622 --> 11:01.902
Our scholars no longer worship
at the shrine of the Northern Qi.

11:03.260 --> 11:07.020
Given what you said,
Fan Xian does deserve to die.

11:09.980 --> 11:11.660
He deceived the Emperor,

11:12.140 --> 11:14.000
so he does deserve to die.

11:14.020 --> 11:16.880
But if he were alive,

11:16.900 --> 11:18.140
he might still be useful.

11:18.140 --> 11:20.480
After all, scholars everywhere

11:20.500 --> 11:24.360
have regarded Fan Xian
as the future master of literature.

11:24.380 --> 11:26.240
If he were alive,

11:26.260 --> 11:31.420
scholars of the Northern Qi
would regard us highly.

11:33.780 --> 11:34.860
Your Majesty,

11:35.020 --> 11:36.480
there are rumors

11:36.500 --> 11:38.120
suggesting that the news of his death

11:38.140 --> 11:39.360
might be misinformation

11:39.380 --> 11:41.420
as it traveled across thousands of li.

11:43.020 --> 11:44.420
That is possible.

11:45.860 --> 11:47.120
Anyway,

11:47.140 --> 11:48.660
deceiving the Emperor

11:49.260 --> 11:50.740
is unforgivable.

11:54.900 --> 11:58.000
However, Fan Xian knows
he is out of favor,

11:58.020 --> 12:00.020
yet still pleads to see you.

12:00.100 --> 12:02.000
This shows that he knows
he has done wrong,

12:02.020 --> 12:03.780
and he doesn't intend to avoid

12:04.380 --> 12:06.300
the death penalty.

12:11.420 --> 12:15.260
This is the gift he prepared.

12:16.100 --> 12:17.940
This young man

12:19.500 --> 12:21.020
was almost killed

12:21.140 --> 12:22.740
when he was in the Northern Qi,

12:23.220 --> 12:24.940
but he still held concern

12:25.140 --> 12:27.020
for you.

12:30.100 --> 12:32.380
He simply deserves to die.

12:35.260 --> 12:36.820
Well, Your Majesty,

12:37.900 --> 12:39.660
why don't you meet with him

12:39.860 --> 12:41.380
before executing him?

12:42.220 --> 12:43.620
There's no rush anyway.

13:02.620 --> 13:04.020
Anything else?

13:05.140 --> 13:06.540
I shall take my leave now.

14:39.260 --> 14:41.020
I, Fan Xian, am sinful.

14:41.300 --> 14:43.140
I deceived you
about my death, Your Majesty.

14:43.380 --> 14:46.420
I'm unforgivable.
I deserve a thousand deaths!

14:53.740 --> 14:56.780
I grew up in Danzhou.

14:57.420 --> 14:59.380
I was oblivious to worldly affairs

14:59.780 --> 15:01.420
and had no lofty ambition.

15:02.220 --> 15:03.660
It wasn't until I came to the Capital

15:03.900 --> 15:05.500
that I got a great promotion.

15:06.260 --> 15:08.260
Without your trust,

15:08.620 --> 15:10.500
I wouldn't have come this far.

15:11.740 --> 15:13.380
Although I have never spoken up,

15:14.020 --> 15:16.940
I could never forget your kindness.

15:21.260 --> 15:23.300
Ever since I was sent
on the diplomatic mission,

15:23.620 --> 15:26.420
I've prepared myself for death.

15:26.660 --> 15:28.140
The matter of life and death

15:28.260 --> 15:31.660
can never surpass
the weight of your trust.

15:33.273 --> 15:34.660
There is only one reason

15:35.300 --> 15:36.820
why I'm seeking an audience
with you today, Your Majesty.

15:37.020 --> 15:40.880
I only wish to report on everything
I learned in the Northern Qi.

15:40.900 --> 15:43.480
My death should never affect

15:43.500 --> 15:45.420
the state affairs.

15:51.660 --> 15:53.660
While in the Northern Qi,

15:53.780 --> 15:56.000
I learned
that the Eldest Princess, Li Yunrui,

15:56.020 --> 15:58.120
and the Second Prince, Li Chengze,

15:58.140 --> 16:00.720
conspired with the Northern Qi's
Embroidered Uniform Guards.

16:00.740 --> 16:03.060
They are suspected
of committing treason.

16:03.740 --> 16:05.400
On the return journey
with the diplomatic corps,

16:05.420 --> 16:07.280
Li Chengze's men

16:07.300 --> 16:09.100
threatened me to surrender
and work for them

16:09.100 --> 16:12.180
using my friends and family.

16:13.020 --> 16:14.820
It was a desperate move

16:15.020 --> 16:17.140
to fake my death to flee.

16:19.500 --> 16:21.260
I may have my reasons,

16:22.020 --> 16:23.780
but this is still an unforgivable act.

16:30.020 --> 16:31.360
If His Majesty doesn't mention

16:31.380 --> 16:32.480
the temple,

16:32.500 --> 16:33.780
do not bring it up.

16:40.102 --> 16:41.300
Apart from that,

16:42.540 --> 16:47.000
before Xiao En's passing,
he told me that the temple

16:47.020 --> 16:48.740
is in the far north.

16:53.140 --> 16:54.780
As for confidential intel as such,

16:55.380 --> 16:58.420
I must either keep it secret
or tell a trustworthy person.

17:01.380 --> 17:03.540
Please assess this matter carefully,
Your Majesty.

17:10.940 --> 17:13.440
I have reported everything
I learned in the Northern Qi

17:13.460 --> 17:15.940
to you, Your Majesty.

17:18.540 --> 17:19.740
Now,

17:20.300 --> 17:21.760
I have no regrets

17:21.780 --> 17:23.500
even if I die.

17:25.020 --> 17:26.780
The only sad thing

17:27.060 --> 17:31.240
is that I won't have a chance
to serve you and this country

17:31.260 --> 17:33.180
after my death.

17:33.260 --> 17:35.920
If my soul lives on after I die,

17:35.940 --> 17:38.000
I will protect you

17:38.020 --> 17:39.980
and the Qing State.

17:40.220 --> 17:43.000
May the Qing State
expand in prosperity.

17:43.020 --> 17:46.180
May you always
be healthy and safe, Your Majesty.

17:46.460 --> 17:47.980
That's all I have to say.

17:48.540 --> 17:50.380
I bow to accept my death.

17:58.780 --> 18:00.180
Get lost!

18:27.683 --> 18:30.064
[Yanhua Hall]

18:35.100 --> 18:37.540
Didn't I tell you to get lost?

18:49.100 --> 18:50.700
Long time no see.

18:56.980 --> 18:58.180
Fan Xian?

19:00.180 --> 19:02.060
Weren't you on a mission
in the Northern Qi?

19:02.340 --> 19:03.940
What are you doing here?

19:04.580 --> 19:06.740
Your Highness, your acting is too much.

19:06.780 --> 19:08.440
[Li Chengqian, Crown Prince]
What... What do you mean?

19:08.460 --> 19:10.040
The elegiac couplet for me
is hanging on the city gate.

19:10.060 --> 19:11.860
How can you not know about my death?

19:12.260 --> 19:13.940
I better not.

19:14.500 --> 19:16.160
What makes a good crown prince?

19:16.180 --> 19:17.840
Ignorance makes a good crown prince.

19:17.860 --> 19:19.480
I'm standing right before you.

19:19.500 --> 19:20.980
I can't see anything.

19:22.300 --> 19:24.520
Don't you want to know
why I faked my death and returned here?

19:24.540 --> 19:25.320
I'm blind.

19:25.340 --> 19:26.580
I'm deaf.

19:27.020 --> 19:28.660
Li Yunrui and Li Chengze conspired

19:28.660 --> 19:30.040
with the Northern Qi's
Embroidered Uniform Guards

19:30.060 --> 19:32.380
in smuggling and embezzlement.
They are up to no good.

19:38.780 --> 19:40.380
Chengze is devious.

19:40.580 --> 19:42.302
[Li Yunrui, Eldest Princess]
He has been coveting

19:42.302 --> 19:43.580
the Imperial Treasury.

19:52.260 --> 19:53.080
No way.

19:53.100 --> 19:54.700
This is impossible!

19:55.420 --> 19:57.460
How could Aunt possibly
be on Chengze's side?

19:57.460 --> 19:59.980
Do you really think
you know the Eldest Princess well?

20:09.260 --> 20:10.260
Where did you get that information?

20:10.260 --> 20:10.764
Shen Zhong, the Commander

20:10.764 --> 20:11.745
of the Pacification Bureau
of the Northern Qi's

20:11.745 --> 20:12.300
Embroidered Uniform Guards.

20:12.300 --> 20:13.500
Do you have any solid proof?

20:13.820 --> 20:16.480
There is a small town named Shijia Town
on the border of the Qing State.

20:16.500 --> 20:18.460
It's a hub where the Northern Qi
stocks and transfers

20:18.460 --> 20:20.240
their smuggled goods.

20:20.260 --> 20:22.000
Look into all the vendors
within this town

20:22.020 --> 20:23.460
and you will find the truth.

20:26.780 --> 20:28.020
You mean all the information you got

20:28.020 --> 20:29.780
is from this Shen Zhong, right?

20:29.780 --> 20:30.740
The young Emperor of the Northern Qi
investigated this for me.

20:30.740 --> 20:31.540
Why would that young Emperor help you?

20:31.540 --> 20:33.100
I took on the smuggling business,

20:33.180 --> 20:34.960
so Li Chengze wanted to kill me.

20:34.980 --> 20:36.940
I will dispatch my men
to Shijia Town immediately.

20:37.260 --> 20:38.780
So you are not deaf now?

20:39.940 --> 20:41.220
At desperate times like this,

20:41.500 --> 20:42.740
I can't hold back anymore.

20:42.860 --> 20:44.340
I will send you back
to the diplomatic corps.

20:44.500 --> 20:46.160
I need to stay in the Capital
for the time being.

20:46.180 --> 20:47.480
You can hide in my residence.

20:47.500 --> 20:49.380
I appreciate that.
But I have something to attend to.

20:50.700 --> 20:52.340
Your life is at stake now,

20:52.420 --> 20:54.160
let me know if you need anything.

20:54.180 --> 20:55.520
I shall thank you in advance.

20:55.540 --> 20:57.080
Your Highness, don't let Li Chengze know

20:57.100 --> 20:58.340
about our collaboration.

20:58.340 --> 20:59.700
Of course.

20:59.740 --> 21:00.480
This is hush-hush.

21:00.500 --> 21:01.440
The guards just now...

21:01.460 --> 21:02.760
I will lock them up for some time.

21:02.780 --> 21:04.000
To think

21:04.020 --> 21:05.840
that the two of us
will join hands one day.

21:05.860 --> 21:07.460
We are just taking what we need.

21:09.500 --> 21:10.580
Take care.

21:11.762 --> 21:17.460
[Yanhua Hall]

21:17.460 --> 21:20.180
All the guards who came to the hall
just now, gather around.

21:27.500 --> 21:28.200
Is everyone here?

21:28.220 --> 21:29.300
Yes.

21:40.300 --> 21:41.860
How could humans

21:42.860 --> 21:44.780
have no sympathy?

21:48.540 --> 21:50.380
They have been serving me for years.

21:50.700 --> 21:52.020
Give them a dignified death.

21:54.980 --> 21:56.640
We have to go now.

21:56.660 --> 21:57.480
If not,

21:57.500 --> 21:59.620
not only can't we save the Tengs,

21:59.660 --> 22:01.100
but my wife and Baba
might also be in danger.

22:01.100 --> 22:02.760
What are you panicking about?

22:02.780 --> 22:04.700
Why did you go to the Crown Prince?

22:04.700 --> 22:06.720
This is considered a private alliance
with him.

22:06.740 --> 22:08.820
Isn't this an even greater offense?

22:08.860 --> 22:09.940
Also,

22:10.180 --> 22:12.540
regarding your recent entry
into the palace,

22:13.260 --> 22:14.960
if someone were to leak the news,

22:14.980 --> 22:16.320
someone might take this opportunity

22:16.340 --> 22:18.720
to ensure your true demise.

22:18.740 --> 22:20.460
Wang, listen to me.

22:21.500 --> 22:22.480
To revive myself,

22:22.500 --> 22:24.760
what matters most is time, right?

22:24.780 --> 22:26.500
If I can't revive myself

22:26.500 --> 22:27.660
before the diplomatic corps
arrive at the Capital,

22:27.660 --> 22:29.400
it will be difficult.

22:29.420 --> 22:31.620
That's why I went to the Crown Prince.

22:31.740 --> 22:34.440
Can he revive you?

22:34.460 --> 22:36.260
That's not it.

22:36.260 --> 22:37.740
It's because I have too little time

22:37.740 --> 22:39.320
to investigate so many things.

22:39.340 --> 22:40.540
It's not feasible for me
to handle it alone,

22:40.540 --> 22:42.160
so we need to divide the work
and cooperate.

22:42.180 --> 22:43.170
I have the Crown Prince investigate

22:43.170 --> 22:44.500
the smuggling activities
of the Second Prince.

22:44.500 --> 22:47.200
You and I will be responsible for tracing
the whereabouts of the Tengs.

22:47.220 --> 22:48.352
Only after we have gotten to the bottom
of everything

22:48.352 --> 22:49.700
can we return to the diplomatic corps.

22:53.500 --> 22:55.620
What if we fail?

22:55.780 --> 22:57.740
If the worst comes to the worst,
all of us die.

22:57.820 --> 22:59.480
Mr. Fan, it can't be that serious.

22:59.500 --> 23:00.180
My wife and Baba...

23:00.180 --> 23:01.000
No, it's not that serious.

23:01.020 --> 23:02.540
Not at all.

23:02.580 --> 23:04.580
There will always be a way.

23:07.501 --> 23:08.640
Speaking of which,

23:08.660 --> 23:09.980
have you found anything yet?

23:11.340 --> 23:14.220
I got some news.

23:15.020 --> 23:16.100
I asked around.

23:16.340 --> 23:17.800
Mr. Fei Jie

23:17.820 --> 23:18.760
isn't in the Capital.

23:18.780 --> 23:20.620
He's out on official business.

23:20.860 --> 23:21.980
He is safe.

23:23.220 --> 23:25.480
As for Young Master Sizhe,

23:25.500 --> 23:27.180
he is also safe.

23:28.100 --> 23:29.300
I did some digging around.

23:29.660 --> 23:32.240
They said he always leaves early
and comes back late.

23:32.260 --> 23:34.080
They don't know what he is busy with.

23:34.100 --> 23:37.380
But there is no sign of abduction.

23:38.700 --> 23:42.620
So the only ones missing are the Tengs?

23:43.460 --> 23:44.620
There is news

23:44.820 --> 23:46.820
about them too.

23:48.980 --> 23:52.540
Someone saw them being taken away.

23:52.780 --> 23:54.340
Did they see where they were taken?

23:58.500 --> 23:59.780
Baoyue Pleasure House.

24:00.500 --> 24:01.860
Baoyue Pleasure House?

24:01.940 --> 24:03.060
What is that place?

24:04.540 --> 24:06.260
A brothel.

24:18.540 --> 24:20.380
Are you really not coming out?

24:20.520 --> 24:22.400
I don't know how much longer
I will have to stay here.

24:22.500 --> 24:24.020
So I had them bring some of my stuff in.

24:27.820 --> 24:29.060
It shouldn't be too long.

24:33.100 --> 24:34.080
Any news?

24:34.100 --> 24:35.740
An intruder met His Majesty.

24:36.500 --> 24:38.380
An intruder met His Majesty?

24:41.100 --> 24:41.800
Fan Xian?

24:41.820 --> 24:45.500
His Majesty wants him
to come back to life honorably.

24:50.660 --> 24:52.620
He doesn't have much time, then.

24:53.420 --> 24:54.920
Once the diplomatic corps
arrive at the Capital

24:54.940 --> 24:56.620
and the dust settles,

24:57.180 --> 24:58.860
his chance is blown.

25:20.260 --> 25:21.320
Fan Xian has been cremated.

25:21.340 --> 25:22.780
Shouldn't we return to the Capital now?

25:23.420 --> 25:24.500
Be patient.

25:25.020 --> 25:26.500
We will keep observing

25:29.500 --> 25:31.260
until we have determined everything.

25:32.020 --> 25:34.300
If His Majesty intended to revive him,

25:34.500 --> 25:37.400
why did he publicly declare

25:37.420 --> 25:38.720
Fan Xian's death?

25:38.740 --> 25:40.300
His Majesty wanted to show
those who went after Fan Xian

25:40.300 --> 25:42.860
what would happen after his death.

25:49.260 --> 25:50.780
The entire world is stunned.

25:51.020 --> 25:52.240
It's as if it's becoming
a state funeral.

25:52.260 --> 25:53.400
After all, Zhuang Mohan

25:53.420 --> 25:55.780
even passed on his collection to him.

25:56.100 --> 25:58.100
That means a great deal.

25:58.420 --> 25:59.980
It symbolizes the legacy
of the literary world.

26:01.660 --> 26:02.780
Aside from that,

26:02.820 --> 26:05.720
His Majesty was giving Fan Xian
a warning.

26:05.740 --> 26:07.060
This young lad is good in every aspect,

26:07.060 --> 26:09.740
except that he is too unconventional.

26:10.100 --> 26:11.320
Will Fan Xian understand that?

26:11.340 --> 26:13.100
He may understand,

26:13.260 --> 26:15.020
but he won't obey.

26:15.260 --> 26:17.220
Actually, this is a good opportunity.

26:26.780 --> 26:28.100
The news of his death
is spreading widely.

26:28.260 --> 26:29.847
If he actually dies now,

26:29.867 --> 26:30.960
no one will say anything

26:30.980 --> 26:32.500
or doubt it.

26:37.580 --> 26:38.240
Where are you going?

26:38.260 --> 26:40.560
Didn't you want me to kill Fan Xian?

26:40.580 --> 26:42.180
Have you even found him yet?

26:44.220 --> 26:45.780
Notify me if you have.

26:56.420 --> 26:57.740
In fact,

26:59.071 --> 27:00.780
it's not easy to track down Fan Xian.

27:01.540 --> 27:03.300
But we can lure him to show himself.

27:03.460 --> 27:05.200
If so, where should he appear?

27:05.220 --> 27:06.500
It will be nowhere

27:06.540 --> 27:08.020
other than the Baoyue Pleasure House.

27:09.460 --> 27:10.780
Baoyue Pleasure House?

27:12.020 --> 27:14.540
If Fan Xian wants to find the Tengs,

27:14.580 --> 27:16.300
he must go to the Baoyue Pleasure House.

27:16.420 --> 27:18.060
Are you not going to help him?

27:22.860 --> 27:24.740
Given the current situation,

27:25.020 --> 27:26.180
His Majesty is watching.

27:26.180 --> 27:26.980
He might not be happy

27:26.980 --> 27:29.700
if I get involved.

27:30.700 --> 27:32.220
Who is behind

27:33.060 --> 27:34.380
this Baoyue Pleasure House?

27:36.847 --> 27:48.020
[Baoyue Pleasure House]

27:48.020 --> 27:49.100
Open up.

27:53.060 --> 27:54.340
May I go in?

27:54.500 --> 27:56.300
Sorry. You can't enter
without the entry pass.

27:57.220 --> 27:57.780
Please do me a favor.

27:57.780 --> 27:58.220
No, I can't.

27:58.220 --> 27:59.620
This way. Please leave.

28:03.946 --> 28:05.175
[Baoyue Pleasure House
Literati Pass]

28:05.175 --> 28:06.574
[The only credential]

28:06.580 --> 28:07.480
Please come in.

28:07.500 --> 28:08.940
Enjoy your time here.

28:24.100 --> 28:26.580
Not just anyone can go in there.

28:26.980 --> 28:28.260
Isn't it a brothel?

28:29.540 --> 28:30.940
It is,

28:30.980 --> 28:32.480
but a fancy one.

28:32.500 --> 28:34.100
They select their customers.

28:34.500 --> 28:37.800
Only those with status and talents

28:37.820 --> 28:39.000
will receive the credential,

28:39.020 --> 28:41.820
which is the only access to it.

28:42.420 --> 28:44.560
It's said to be quieter and more elegant

28:44.580 --> 28:46.480
than other brothels.

28:46.500 --> 28:48.560
I see, it's a membership system.

28:48.580 --> 28:50.020
What is a membership system?

28:50.180 --> 28:51.720
Nothing. This credential...

28:51.740 --> 28:53.460
It's hard to get.

28:53.780 --> 28:55.300
But I asked someone just now.

28:55.580 --> 28:58.260
We now have an amazing opportunity.

28:58.260 --> 28:59.240
What is it?

28:59.260 --> 29:00.920
There is a mourning event

29:00.940 --> 29:02.520
for the Immortal Poet.

29:02.540 --> 29:04.260
They are mourning for you.

29:04.500 --> 29:07.540
So by mourning for me, we'll get
into the Baoyue Pleasure House?

29:07.820 --> 29:10.200
If one performs well,
they will be granted the credential

29:10.220 --> 29:13.000
to enter the Baoyue Pleasure House.

29:13.020 --> 29:14.800
Well, what makes a good performance?

29:14.820 --> 29:15.900
Everyone,

29:16.020 --> 29:17.240
today,

29:17.260 --> 29:20.980
[In memory of Immortal Poet, Fan Xian]
we also have the three revered judges

29:21.020 --> 29:24.540
with us
in this incredible mourning event.

29:25.460 --> 29:27.480
Any mourner

29:27.500 --> 29:30.580
who gains recognition
from the three judges

29:30.940 --> 29:33.580
will receive the Literati Pass.

29:33.780 --> 29:36.700
It grants you access
to the Baoyue Pleasure House.

29:45.780 --> 29:47.000
What are they doing?

29:47.020 --> 29:48.720
Do you not see

29:48.740 --> 29:53.540
that the Yellow River descends
from the sky?

29:53.860 --> 29:56.260
It's your drunken poem
in the Qinian Hall.

29:56.260 --> 29:59.000
I'm blessed with talents from birth,

29:59.020 --> 30:02.040
no matter what I expend,
I'll find ways to replenish them.

30:02.060 --> 30:05.620
[Pass]
Bravo!

30:07.460 --> 30:08.800
They are imitating you.

30:08.820 --> 30:11.020
They are good mourners.

30:11.180 --> 30:13.280
How come this sounds kind of weird?

30:13.300 --> 30:15.060
Because they are mourning your death.

30:15.660 --> 30:17.380
The Great Mr. Fan!

30:18.340 --> 30:20.300
The Great Mr. Fan!

30:20.500 --> 30:22.100
Mister, what weapon do you prefer?

30:22.100 --> 30:23.500
Sword, of course.

30:38.780 --> 30:39.720
How awkward.

30:39.740 --> 30:40.820
[Fail]
Look,

30:40.940 --> 30:43.300
those are bad mourners.

30:43.340 --> 30:44.860
So this is a mimicry show.

30:46.260 --> 30:48.480
I think I can understand mimicry,

30:48.500 --> 30:50.580
but what is "show"?

30:50.780 --> 30:53.300
Just show.

30:55.940 --> 30:57.580
You are skinnier than me.
[*Show and skinny are homophones]

30:59.500 --> 31:02.620
I cannot forget how mortified I was
about the defeat in the Huangkong Bund.

31:07.180 --> 31:08.300
Judges,

31:09.420 --> 31:10.540
please try this.

31:11.060 --> 31:13.480
We may be far apart,

31:13.500 --> 31:16.500
but our hearts are close.

31:16.500 --> 31:18.380
I... I will do it again.

31:19.260 --> 31:20.800
Let me try again.

31:20.820 --> 31:22.620
Give me one more chance.

31:23.940 --> 31:26.080
Do I look like him?

31:26.100 --> 31:26.960
What do you think?

31:26.980 --> 31:28.800
That is a bad mourner.

31:28.820 --> 31:32.060
He is not as "skinny" as you.

31:33.340 --> 31:34.280
Don't you think

31:34.300 --> 31:36.340
this is an incredible opportunity
for us?

31:36.500 --> 31:40.020
No one can do better
than the Immortal Poet himself.

31:44.500 --> 31:45.580
Mr. Fan,

31:45.780 --> 31:47.260
aren't we going to sneak
into the Baoyue Pleasure House

31:47.260 --> 31:48.720
for some scouting?

31:48.740 --> 31:50.740
Why don't you join the mimicry show?

31:50.980 --> 31:53.400
If the Baoyue Pleasure House
is open to the public,

31:53.420 --> 31:54.560
I may give it a shot.

31:54.580 --> 31:55.660
Mr. Fan.

31:58.660 --> 32:00.340
Why did you give Mr. Fan this?

32:01.220 --> 32:02.860
This... This is quite good.

32:04.260 --> 32:06.220
Dear, let me do it.

32:15.580 --> 32:18.160
Are you worried

32:18.180 --> 32:20.100
someone might recognize you?

32:20.260 --> 32:22.380
Even if I could get away with that,

32:22.740 --> 32:25.220
I don't think I can conceal myself

32:25.500 --> 32:26.980
if I go there alone.

32:27.100 --> 32:29.440
I think the mourning event
at the Baoyue Pleasure House

32:29.460 --> 32:30.940
might be a trap.

32:32.180 --> 32:33.740
Like a turkey shoot.

32:33.820 --> 32:34.480
To shoot you.

32:34.500 --> 32:36.240
No, that's not what I mean.

32:36.260 --> 32:38.980
If so, we should sneak into the building

32:39.020 --> 32:40.960
when the night is dark.

32:40.980 --> 32:42.520
We only have one chance.

32:42.540 --> 32:44.300
I'm afraid we might alert them.

32:45.400 --> 32:47.760
Who is in charge
of the Baoyue Pleasure House?

32:47.780 --> 32:49.240
I need to investigate.

32:49.260 --> 32:50.380
Yuan Meng.

32:51.820 --> 32:53.180
Who is Yuan Meng?

33:15.500 --> 33:18.440
Mr. Fan, please write me a poem!

33:18.460 --> 33:20.060
Mr. Fan!

33:20.860 --> 33:22.260
Mr. Fan, you are great!

33:22.260 --> 33:24.420
Mr. Fan!

33:24.420 --> 33:26.060
You are finally here!

33:26.813 --> 33:28.954
[Yuan Meng,
the Head of the Baoyue Pleasure House]

33:36.460 --> 33:38.640
Yuan Meng, Madam Yuan.

33:38.660 --> 33:39.480
Retreat.

33:39.500 --> 33:41.380
She was once the top courtesan
around the Liujing River.

33:41.540 --> 33:44.700
She was the most famous before Si Lili.

33:45.700 --> 33:47.820
How did you know about this?

33:48.820 --> 33:51.800
We used to sell rouge and fragrance.

33:51.820 --> 33:54.780
I know a thing or two
about the brothel business.

33:55.220 --> 33:56.280
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

33:56.300 --> 33:57.740
Don't blame him.

33:57.820 --> 33:59.200
Qinian isn't quite involved

33:59.220 --> 34:00.820
in this line of business.

34:01.780 --> 34:03.500
I have to avoid it.

34:04.780 --> 34:06.300
You are a role model for a husband.

34:06.700 --> 34:07.560
Mr. Fan,

34:07.580 --> 34:08.700
should we start

34:08.700 --> 34:11.460
with Yuan Meng?

34:12.180 --> 34:14.780
Is Yuan Meng the owner
of the Baoyue Pleasure House?

34:19.100 --> 34:20.400
She takes charge of the brothel,

34:20.420 --> 34:21.900
but she doesn't own it.

34:22.620 --> 34:24.820
The identity of the owner

34:25.460 --> 34:26.820
is a mystery.

34:26.980 --> 34:28.300
No one has ever seen this person.

34:29.180 --> 34:31.440
If we want to find the Tengs,

34:31.460 --> 34:34.340
we must track down
this mysterious owner.

34:34.860 --> 34:36.240
Those outside the brothel may not know,

34:36.260 --> 34:37.740
but those inside

34:37.820 --> 34:39.220
might.

34:40.860 --> 34:41.920
Do you know someone there?

34:41.940 --> 34:43.380
There is this young lady

34:43.540 --> 34:45.100
who's Qinian's acquaintance.

34:47.740 --> 34:49.100
No way.

34:49.140 --> 34:50.680
This is impossible, Mr. Fan.

34:50.700 --> 34:54.140
I value my reputation
more than anything in my life.

34:54.180 --> 34:56.680
My unsullied reputation

34:56.700 --> 34:57.920
can speak for itself.

34:57.940 --> 35:01.380
Don't believe in rumors, dear.

35:01.433 --> 35:03.073
Miss Sang Wen.

35:05.740 --> 35:08.500
Why did it slip out of my hands?

35:09.260 --> 35:10.700
You are sweating, huh?

35:11.700 --> 35:13.420
Didn't we deliver
the rouge and fragrance

35:13.420 --> 35:15.820
directly to Miss Sang Wen?

35:16.820 --> 35:18.460
You are right.

35:18.700 --> 35:21.900
But I have nothing to do with her.

35:24.220 --> 35:26.380
Mr. Fan, I remember it now.

35:26.660 --> 35:29.600
At first, I sold music scores to her,

35:29.620 --> 35:32.560
then a guqin,

35:32.580 --> 35:35.060
and finally, the fragrance
as my wife mentioned.

35:35.740 --> 35:37.680
You sold her quite a few things.

35:37.700 --> 35:38.980
Anything else?

35:39.660 --> 35:42.220
Maps and Red Mansion.

35:42.220 --> 35:43.740
You know that.

35:43.900 --> 35:46.080
But after I encountered you,

35:46.100 --> 35:48.300
I only sell my services.

35:49.460 --> 35:50.540
Dear,

35:50.580 --> 35:52.680
if you hadn't mentioned

35:52.700 --> 35:54.140
Sang... What's the name again?

35:54.140 --> 35:55.760
I would've forgotten her.

35:55.780 --> 35:58.580
Now, Miss Sang Wen is
in the Baoyue Pleasure House.

35:58.780 --> 36:02.300
Didn't she say
she'd only sing and not...?

36:10.780 --> 36:11.940
You are lucky, Mr. Fan.

36:11.940 --> 36:14.260
It seems
that Qinian still remembers her.

36:14.460 --> 36:17.340
He can put you in touch with her.

36:21.660 --> 36:23.140
Why is it broken?

36:23.180 --> 36:24.420
- No idea.
- No idea.

36:26.700 --> 36:28.060
I will get a new one.

36:39.220 --> 36:40.300
Me?

36:40.780 --> 36:42.740
I will look for a new one for you.

36:46.660 --> 36:48.080
Maybe I don't need the tea...

36:48.100 --> 36:49.180
Right.

36:49.380 --> 36:50.820
Why not?

36:51.140 --> 36:52.420
I'll go along as you wish.

37:12.860 --> 37:14.300
Where is the spoon?

37:15.060 --> 37:16.260
Right here.

37:16.980 --> 37:18.060
Off you go.

37:18.260 --> 37:20.660
Mr. Fan is waiting
to hear about Miss Sang from you.

37:23.180 --> 37:25.520
No, I'm really not familiar with her.

37:25.540 --> 37:27.400
Besides, she
is in the Baoyue Pleasure House, right?

37:27.420 --> 37:28.640
Even if I want to meet with her,

37:28.660 --> 37:30.220
I don't stand a chance.

37:34.820 --> 37:36.560
You even think about meeting her?

37:36.580 --> 37:37.740
No, I... I...

37:37.860 --> 37:39.880
Of course, I must think about it.

37:39.900 --> 37:41.700
I must think of a sure-fire plan

37:41.700 --> 37:44.060
for Mr. Fan.

37:47.340 --> 37:48.420
Mr. Fan.

37:50.780 --> 37:51.860
Mr. Fan.

37:52.420 --> 37:53.700
Don't look.

37:54.820 --> 37:55.900
It's getting red?

37:56.340 --> 37:58.040
She has long fingers.

37:58.060 --> 37:59.420
It will fade after a while.

37:59.740 --> 38:00.820
Mr. Fan,

38:01.340 --> 38:03.660
there is a way to meet her.

38:04.220 --> 38:05.800
These courtesans

38:05.820 --> 38:07.680
would go out to purchase

38:07.700 --> 38:09.280
rouge and clothes.

38:09.300 --> 38:10.240
Which store?

38:10.260 --> 38:11.740
I know where they visit.

38:12.940 --> 38:14.680
If we want to find Sang Wen,

38:14.700 --> 38:16.760
we have to wait for her to come to us.

38:16.780 --> 38:19.340
Can you sneak into the store?

38:21.380 --> 38:22.460
I know the owners.

38:23.300 --> 38:25.240
Wang, you do deserve this slap.

38:25.260 --> 38:27.380
Wait, don't get the wrong idea.

38:27.460 --> 38:28.260
I just make a little money

38:28.260 --> 38:30.580
from them occasionally.

38:30.580 --> 38:32.340
That's all.

38:33.860 --> 38:35.100
If you don't believe me...

38:39.860 --> 38:41.040
I'm not lying, right?

38:41.060 --> 38:42.860
Why didn't you explain to her?

38:44.180 --> 38:47.300
Mr. Fan, you aren't married.
You wouldn't know.

38:47.860 --> 38:49.920
Even if I didn't lie,

38:49.940 --> 38:52.080
I shouldn't talk back.

38:52.100 --> 38:54.220
Otherwise, it will be troublesome.

38:54.420 --> 38:55.900
Women

38:55.980 --> 38:57.780
shouldn't be suspicious,

38:58.060 --> 38:59.240
while men

38:59.260 --> 39:01.260
should count their blessings.

39:01.940 --> 39:04.060
Marriage isn't easy.

39:05.100 --> 39:06.360
Well, let's go.

39:06.380 --> 39:07.580
Let's go.

39:12.740 --> 39:13.820
Dear.

39:15.540 --> 39:17.580
I'm heading out for some business
with Mr. Fan.

39:17.580 --> 39:20.360
Remember to bring back
a blue-flowered handkerchief.

39:20.380 --> 39:21.460
Sure thing.

39:23.580 --> 39:24.660
What's wrong?

39:25.260 --> 39:25.980
What does she mean?

39:25.980 --> 39:27.500
What are you talking about?

39:27.580 --> 39:29.460
The store we are heading to

39:29.780 --> 39:32.420
is famous for
its blue-flowered handkerchiefs.

39:35.420 --> 39:36.660
Interesting.

39:52.340 --> 39:53.060
Hurry.

39:53.060 --> 39:55.340
Ladies from the Baoyue Pleasure House
are coming out.

39:55.460 --> 39:57.100
How beautiful.

39:57.620 --> 39:58.780
Make way.

40:06.460 --> 40:08.140
Hey, move aside.

40:11.980 --> 40:14.180
They all look like fairies.

40:14.220 --> 40:15.200
Miss, have a look at this.

40:15.220 --> 40:17.460
This is the latest design.

40:17.540 --> 40:19.380
It's perfect for you.

40:20.340 --> 40:22.180
Don't push me.

40:23.260 --> 40:24.780
You have fine taste.

40:28.380 --> 40:29.820
This is not bad.

40:30.540 --> 40:31.820
This is good too.

40:32.900 --> 40:34.460
Look at this. What do you think?

40:36.180 --> 40:37.760
This is my favorite color.

40:37.780 --> 40:39.700
The embroidery is exquisite.

40:40.900 --> 40:43.860
This is hand-embroidered.
It's beautiful, isn't it?

40:50.180 --> 40:51.660
Miss Sang Wen.

40:52.871 --> 40:55.098
[Sang Wen, the Singer
of the Baoyue Pleasure House]

40:57.860 --> 40:59.320
Wanxia and Ruyan came here yesterday.

40:59.340 --> 41:01.880
So I guessed you would be here soon.

41:01.900 --> 41:03.380
I have prepared the thing

41:03.380 --> 41:05.220
you requested back then.

41:08.660 --> 41:09.820
This way, please.

41:20.260 --> 41:21.460
Are you going in with me?

41:32.860 --> 41:34.300
Miss.

41:35.420 --> 41:36.500
Don't shout.

41:36.860 --> 41:38.460
We met before.

41:38.780 --> 41:41.260
It's me. Wang Qinian.

41:42.580 --> 41:44.660
I'm wearing a disguise.

41:44.940 --> 41:46.300
Take this.

41:49.780 --> 41:52.040
This is Mr. Zhao.

41:52.060 --> 41:53.940
He has admired you for a long time

41:54.060 --> 41:55.840
and he simply wants to meet you.

41:55.860 --> 41:56.840
He means no harm.

41:56.860 --> 41:58.780
Don't tell anyone.

42:01.860 --> 42:03.080
This gift is too much,

42:03.100 --> 42:04.300
Mr. Fan.

42:04.460 --> 42:05.320
No, he is not.

42:05.340 --> 42:06.420
He's Zhao.

42:07.380 --> 42:08.460
I met you before.

42:09.420 --> 42:10.360
Where?

42:10.380 --> 42:13.120
When Miss Si Lili lit fireworks
and rode on a boat

42:13.140 --> 42:14.780
to meet with you that night,

42:14.860 --> 42:16.380
I was watching from upstairs.

42:16.860 --> 42:18.260
We are fated to meet, then.

42:19.380 --> 42:20.600
I heard

42:20.620 --> 42:21.820
that you are dead.

42:21.940 --> 42:23.220
I heard about that too.

42:23.860 --> 42:24.880
My condolences.

42:24.900 --> 42:25.960
Thank you.

42:25.980 --> 42:27.380
I will move on.

42:33.140 --> 42:34.220
What do you mean?

42:36.980 --> 42:38.300
Mr. Fan,

42:38.780 --> 42:40.300
do you want to investigate
the Baoyue Pleasure House?

42:40.540 --> 42:41.280
Who told you that?

42:41.300 --> 42:43.060
Not me.

42:43.900 --> 42:45.360
You came back from the dead

42:45.380 --> 42:46.720
and waited to meet me at this place.

42:46.740 --> 42:49.060
I suppose you can't be interested in me.

42:49.780 --> 42:51.460
I'm just an ordinary woman.

42:51.620 --> 42:52.760
Except for the Baoyue Pleasure House,

42:52.780 --> 42:55.180
everything around me is ordinary.

42:56.220 --> 42:58.860
What's unusual
about the Baoyue Pleasure House, then?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.313
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.333 --> 44:32.253
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
